```

## Project Structure

```
.
├── main.py                           # Entry point (imports and creates app)
├── src/
│   └── {benchmark_package}/
│       ├── __init__.py
│       └── benchmark_service.py      # ExampleBenchmark implementation
├── tests/                            # Tests
├── .github/workflows/                # CI/CD
├── pyproject.toml                    # Dependencies
├── Dockerfile                        # Container image
└── Makefile                          # Commands
```

The `main.py` file is just:
```python
from benchmark_service import create_app
from {benchmark_package}.benchmark_service import ExampleBenchmark

app = create_app(ExampleBenchmark())
```

All implementation details are in `src/{benchmark_package}/benchmark_service.py`.

## Framework Updates

To update the benchmark service framework:

```bash
make update-benchmark-service
```
